          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body secretions (primarily saliva) · may be genital - incubation ~1–2mo → pts often ⍉recall contact - freq in young adults (most aSx)"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
